1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:08,171
The treads of a Merkava tank were far quieter than people imagine. Silent. Ominously silent.

2
00:00:08,171 --> 00:00:16,184
For Mohammad Kasser at a Hezbollah lookout post, the tanks he couldn't see were the most terrifying.

3
00:00:16,184 --> 00:00:20,831
If you could see them, at least you knew which way to run.

4
00:00:20,831 --> 00:00:23,035
This was not an air strike.

5
00:00:23,035 --> 00:00:25,891
Air strikes came down from the sky.

6
00:00:25,891 --> 00:00:30,462
This came across the ground. Armor. Infantry. Artillery.

7
00:00:30,462 --> 00:00:32,339
The oldest form of war.

8
00:00:32,339 --> 00:00:34,216
He picked up his AK-47.

9
00:00:34,216 --> 00:00:36,338
He couldn't shoot the sky.

10
00:00:36,338 --> 00:00:38,379
He couldn't stop a drone.

11
00:00:38,379 --> 00:00:40,664
A border is a line on a map.

12
00:00:40,664 --> 00:00:45,234
Tank treads roll right over it — and the line is erased.

